EVALUATION.md §4.2, §7.3: an entry's field is the value of `base` it read, the same node; a value
converted later marks that node invalid (E3204), in `base` too. A replay puts back the node of the
`base` it forced, so the later mark reaches both as evaluating does (log-2026-09-29 M4 U11).
-- memo --
stored 1 unkept 0
